cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "jansky-forge: Antenna design, build, and characterization for radio astronomy"
abstract: >-
  A cross-platform toolkit for designing, building, and characterizing
  radio-astronomy antennas. Closed-form analytic models recompute in
  microseconds so design exploration is interactive; a provenance-checked
  catalog of known telescope builds (dishes and horns) provides starting
  points; fabrication artifacts turn a design into cut metal; and measured
  performance is reported beside — never merged into — model predictions.
  Sibling of the jansky course, jansky-research, and jansky-observe.
type: software
